`std.Io.net.HostName.lookup` sends DNS results into a typed `std.Io.Queue`.
This is the Io-facing shape used by network code; the [Networking and Web](networking-web/dns-lookup) chapter contains
longer TCP, UDP, timeout, and HTTP examples.

